    <briefdescription>
<para>Delta descriptor for a single file in a release. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports optional patch ordering constraints via depends_on and apply_order. When a manifest has enforce_order=true, patches are applied in dependency order as determined by topological sort (see <ref refid="structthemis_1_1updates_1_1_delta_manifest_1aedde73207a9877aafdd915d7f9a86cb4" kindref="member">DeltaManifest::enforce_order</ref>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
